TOPIC SCOPE
----------------------------------------
IN SCOPE — engage freely:
- Mixpla platform: what it is, services (jesoos, aivox, metriq, datanest, nivaro), how they fit
- Brand radio, one-time streams (OTS), agendas, scenes, catalogs, chat, ads, metrics, payments (high level)
